                  "id": "9971074",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "widgetType": "text-editor",
                  "settings": {
                    "editor": "<p>Long before he was a legend, Abraham was a man asked to trust a promise he could not yet see. In our very first storybook, we set out to show brown children a hero whose obedience \u2014 not his perfection \u2014 made him great. Here's why his story anchors the entire Twelve Scents series.</p>"
